    <div data-w-id="625924bc-7985-7a4e-eab8-0e3626362fcb" class="intro-section">
      <div class="intro-text-wrapper">
        <h5 data-w-id="2586849a-e324-93d1-ae6a-b376ced6dabe" style="opacity:0" class="intro-text">Find out what to expect during a tsunami and the actions you can take to stay safe until the All Clear is issued.</h5>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="what-to-expect" class="content-section">
      <div data-w-id="adf46db4-b934-1d11-784e-13fa39ab5ce9" style="opacity:0" class="content-heading-wrapper">
        <h2 class="content-heading">What to expect</h2>
      </div>
      <div data-w-id="adf46db4-b934-1d11-784e-13fa39ab5ced" style="opacity:0" class="content-heading-underline-wrapper">
        <div class="content-heading-blue-underline"></div>
        <div class="content-heading-grey-underline"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="content-wrapper">
        <div class="content-columns w-row">
          <div data-w-id="adf46db4-b934-1d11-784e-13fa39ab5cf2" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="text-column w-col w-col-4 w-col-stack">
            <div class="content w-richtext">
              <p>A tsunami can impact the WA coastline as a land or marine threat. Regardless of which threat is issued, follow the advice of DFES and the <a href="http://www.bom.gov.au/wa/?ref=hdr" target="_blank">Bureau of Meteorology</a>. If required to evacuate, do not return to the shore after the first wave. Wait for DFES officials to give the All Clear before you return.</p>
              <p>During a tsunami, you can expect dangerous rips, waves, and strong currents that may last for several hours.</p>
              <p>When there is a marine threat beaches, rock pools and other foreshore areas are not safe, and there may be some localised land flooding immediately adjoining the foreshore.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div data-w-id="adf46db4-b934-1d11-784e-13fa39ab5cfd" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="image-column w-col w-col-8 w-col-stack"><img src="../../../images/tsunami-expect.jpg" loading="lazy" srcset="../../../images/tsunami-expect-p-500.jpg 500w, ../../../images/tsunami-expect.jpg 800w" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 95vw, (max-width: 888px) 90vw, (max-width: 991px) 800px, 59vw" alt=""></div>
        </div>
        <div class="content-columns margin-top img w-row">
          <div data-w-id="5afdfc9b-d5da-dd13-5770-901ce2718465" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="image-column-left w-col w-col-8 w-col-stack"><img src="../../../images/tsunami-expect-2.jpg" loading="lazy" srcset="../../../images/tsunami-expect-2-p-500.jpg 500w, ../../../images/tsunami-expect-2.jpg 800w" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 95vw, (max-width: 888px) 90vw, (max-width: 991px) 800px, 59vw" alt=""></div>
          <div data-w-id="5afdfc9b-d5da-dd13-5770-901ce2718467" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="text-column-right w-col w-col-4 w-col-stack">
            <div class="content w-richtext">
              <p>During a land threat, there may be flooding to low-lying coastal areas, dangerous waves and strong ocean currents that may last several hours. </p>
              <p>Tsunamis that present a land threat are much less frequent than those that present a marine threat. However, when they do occur, they are extremely dangerous.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" class="full-width-dropdown w-dropdown">
          <div class="full-width-dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><img src="../../../images/tsunami-icon-black.svg" loading="lazy" width="30" alt="" class="dropdown-icon">
            <div>When DFES issues an alert</div>
          </div>
          <nav class="dropdown-wrapper no-border w-dropdown-list">
            <div class="content w-richtext">
              <ul role="list">
                <li>Follow directions on how to stay safe in the official warning on <a href="https://www.emergency.wa.gov.au/" target="_blank">Emergency WA</a>.</li>
                <li>Remind everyone in the household of your tsunami plan, including the procedure for pets and animals.</li>
                <li>Locate your emergency kit and add your additional items.</li>
                <li>Call 000 in a life-threatening situation.</li>
                <li>Check on family, friends, and neighbours.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </nav>
        </div>
        <div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" class="full-width-dropdown w-dropdown">
          <div class="full-width-dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><img src="../../../images/house-icon.svg" loading="lazy" width="30" alt="" class="dropdown-icon">
            <div>If you are at home</div>
          </div>
          <nav class="dropdown-wrapper no-border w-dropdown-list">
            <div class="content w-richtext">
              <ul role="list">
                <li>Turn off electricity, water, and gas and unplug all electrical appliances.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </nav>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="leaving-early" class="content-section">
      <div data-w-id="2b65cfc9-a5ef-4581-c457-d60da1ddf457" style="opacity:0" class="content-heading-wrapper">
        <h2 class="content-heading">Leaving early for a safer place</h2>
      </div>
      <div data-w-id="2b65cfc9-a5ef-4581-c457-d60da1ddf45b" style="opacity:0" class="content-heading-underline-wrapper">
        <div class="content-heading-blue-underline"></div>
        <div class="content-heading-grey-underline"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="content-wrapper">
        <div class="content-columns w-row">
          <div data-w-id="56fa2448-41f8-8097-27b7-fb54b9a635c9" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="text-column w-col w-col-4 w-col-stack">
            <div class="content w-richtext">
              <p>If a tsunami is threatening your location, you should relocate to a safer place early. Leaving at the last minute could put your life in danger. When relocating, walk if possible to avoid traffic congestion.</p>
              <p><strong>When relocating:</strong></p>
              <ul role="list">
                <li>Take your tsunami emergency kit.</li>
                <li>Check if your planned route has been impacted.</li>
                <li>If you have to drive, keep your fuel tank topped up and never drive through flood waters.</li>
                <li>Tell someone about your travel plans.</li>
                <li>Keep up to date via <a href="https://www.emergency.wa.gov.au/" target="_blank">Emergency WA</a> or ABC Radio.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div data-w-id="56fa2448-41f8-8097-27b7-fb54b9a635cd" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="image-column w-col w-col-8 w-col-stack"><img src="../../../images/tsunami-leaving-early.jpg" loading="lazy" srcset="../../../images/tsunami-leaving-early-p-500.jpg 500w, ../../../images/tsunami-leaving-early.jpg 800w" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 95vw, (max-width: 888px) 90vw, (max-width: 991px) 800px, 59vw" alt=""></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="traveling" class="content-section">
      <div data-w-id="7c6872f0-6605-eccd-a73f-01900d1c47b9" style="opacity:0" class="content-heading-wrapper">
        <h2 class="content-heading">Travelling during or after a tsunami</h2>
      </div>
      <div data-w-id="7c6872f0-6605-eccd-a73f-01900d1c47bc" style="opacity:0" class="content-heading-underline-wrapper">
        <div class="content-heading-blue-underline"></div>
        <div class="content-heading-grey-underline"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="content-wrapper">
        <div class="content-columns image-first w-row">
          <div data-w-id="da005dab-f661-7db6-a3a9-fec2a131d70c" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="image-column-left w-col w-col-8 w-col-stack"><img src="../../../images/tsunami-road-closed.jpg" loading="lazy" srcset="../../../images/tsunami-road-closed-p-500.jpg 500w, ../../../images/tsunami-road-closed.jpg 800w" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 95vw, (max-width: 888px) 90vw, (max-width: 991px) 800px, 59vw" alt=""></div>
          <div data-w-id="da005dab-f661-7db6-a3a9-fec2a131d70e" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="text-column-right left w-col w-col-4 w-col-stack">
            <div class="content w-richtext">
              <p>After a tsunami, there is the risk of flooding in low-lying coastal areas and estuaries. Water can be deep, fast flowing with strong currents and have sharp objects that can injure or trap you. It is important to know the dangers of driving in flood waters.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" class="full-width-dropdown w-dropdown">
          <div class="full-width-dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><img src="../../../images/caravan-icon.svg" loading="lazy" width="30" alt="" class="dropdown-icon">
            <div>Know the risks of tsunami-driven floodwaters</div>
          </div>
          <nav class="dropdown-wrapper no-border w-dropdown-list">
            <div class="content w-richtext">
              <p>Due to the following hazards, travelling during or after a tsunami can be extremely dangerous:</p>
              <ul role="list">
                <li><strong>Currents: </strong>A seemingly calm surface can mask a fast-moving body of water below, powerful enough to float your vehicle.</li>
                <li><strong>Debris:</strong> Rubbish, rocks, tree branches, and other sharp objects can hide under a smooth surface.</li>
                <li><strong>Bacteria: </strong> If a tsunami impacts land, the water will likely contain sewage and bacteria. These harmful contaminants can cause serious illness or death.</li>
              </ul>
              <p><strong>If tsunami inundation impacts roads, the same considerations apply as those for areas impacted by floodwaters.</strong></p>
            </div>
          </nav>
        </div>
        <div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" class="full-width-dropdown w-dropdown">
          <div class="full-width-dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><img src="../../../images/flood-icon-black.svg" loading="lazy" width="30" alt="" class="dropdown-icon">
            <div>When you see floodwaters, STOP.</div>
          </div>
          <nav class="dropdown-wrapper no-border w-dropdown-list">
            <div class="content w-richtext">
              <p>If a road is closed, obey road closures and check road conditions if there are no signs.</p>
              <ul role="list">
                <li><strong>Review your travel plans: </strong>It is essential to review your travel plans if the region you are travelling through has or is likely to experience tsunami-driven flooding.</li>
                <li><strong>Keep your fuel tank topped up:</strong> Access to service stations can be limited. In the event of a tsunami, queues will be long, and fuel supplies may be interrupted. Keep your tank as full as possible during your trip and carry spare fuel.</li>
                <li><strong>Tell someone about your travel plans:</strong> Ensure someone knows your travel plans, including when you will be travelling between destinations. Let them know when you have arrived safely.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </nav>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="staying-at-home" class="content-section">
      <div data-w-id="6e95db19-3787-fc33-fdfd-a0efcfe75d29" style="opacity:0" class="content-heading-wrapper">
        <h2 class="content-heading">If you shelter at home</h2>
      </div>
      <div data-w-id="6e95db19-3787-fc33-fdfd-a0efcfe75d2d" style="opacity:0" class="content-heading-underline-wrapper">
        <div class="content-heading-blue-underline"></div>
        <div class="content-heading-grey-underline"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="content-wrapper">
        <div class="content-columns w-row">
          <div data-w-id="10bcef55-64a8-c786-7d02-b7125f05bc7b" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="text-column w-col w-col-4 w-col-stack">
            <div class="content w-richtext">
              <p>If you choose to shelter in your home during a tsunami, it is essential that you first know the risks, understand what you may experience and follow these steps:</p>
              <ul role="list">
                <li>Ensure you have secured your home and property.</li>
                <li>Make sure you have a comprehensive emergency kit, including supplies to last five days for your entire household.</li>
                <li>Relocate household members to the highest safe place.</li>
                <li>Inform family, friends and authorities that you are staying.</li>
                <li>Plan to manage without electricity, water, gas and other essential services.</li>
                <li>Stay informed for official advice via radio or other working telecommunications.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div data-w-id="10bcef55-64a8-c786-7d02-b7125f05bc85" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="image-column w-col w-col-8 w-col-stack"><img src="../../../images/tsunami-shelter-at-home.jpg" loading="lazy" srcset="../../../images/tsunami-shelter-at-home-p-500.jpg 500w, ../../../images/tsunami-shelter-at-home.jpg 800w" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 95vw, (max-width: 888px) 90vw, (max-width: 991px) 800px, 59vw" alt=""></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="in-life-threatening-situations" class="content-section">
      <div data-w-id="71df7ab2-16d5-3133-222f-a1feac09415b" style="opacity:0" class="content-heading-wrapper">
        <h2 class="content-heading">In life threatening situations</h2>
      </div>
      <div data-w-id="71df7ab2-16d5-3133-222f-a1feac09415f" style="opacity:0" class="content-heading-underline-wrapper">
        <div class="content-heading-blue-underline"></div>
        <div class="content-heading-grey-underline"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="content-wrapper">
        <div class="content-columns image-first w-row">
          <div data-w-id="179ed527-7c47-111e-0bed-01e9bb9c3757" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="image-column-left w-col w-col-8 w-col-stack"><img src="../../../images/ses-graphic_1.jpg" loading="lazy" srcset="../../../images/ses-graphic_1-p-500.jpg 500w, ../../../images/ses-graphic_1.jpg 800w" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 95vw, (max-width: 888px) 90vw, (max-width: 991px) 800px, 59vw" alt=""></div>
          <div data-w-id="179ed527-7c47-111e-0bed-01e9bb9c3759" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="text-column-right left w-col w-col-4 w-col-stack">
            <div class="content w-richtext">
              <p>Even if you have planned well, life-threatening situations can still happen. Your shelter could be damaged, or someone could become ill or injured.</p>
              <p>For life-threatening emergencies, call 000.</p>
              <p>Emergency services will try to come to your aid. However, there may be delays due to the dangerous conditions.</p>
              <p>If your property is damaged and unsafe, call the State Emergency Service on 132 500 for assistance.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" class="full-width-dropdown w-dropdown">
          <div class="full-width-dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><img src="../../../images/campfire-safety-icon.svg" loading="lazy" width="30" alt="" class="dropdown-icon">
            <div>Wait for the All Clear</div>
          </div>
          <nav class="dropdown-wrapper no-border w-dropdown-list">
            <div class="content w-richtext">
              <p>Once the tsunami risk has passed and the All Clear has been issued, you can leave your safe place. However, you must do so with caution and follow the safety advice in the warning. Do not return to the water until you have received official advice that it is safe to do so.</p>
            </div>
          </nav>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="stay-informed" class="content-section">
      <div data-w-id="0afd2dfa-ade2-84c1-a97c-3f0c589c9d5b" style="opacity:0" class="content-heading-wrapper">
        <h2 class="content-heading">How to stay informed</h2>
      </div>
      <div data-w-id="0afd2dfa-ade2-84c1-a97c-3f0c589c9d5e" style="opacity:0" class="content-heading-underline-wrapper">
        <div class="content-heading-blue-underline"></div>
        <div class="content-heading-grey-underline"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="content-wrapper">
        <div class="two-column-text-only w-row">
          <div data-w-id="0afd2dfa-ade2-84c1-a97c-3f0c589c9d63" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(-100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="text-only-column-left w-col w-col-6 w-col-stack">
            <div href="" class="content w-richtext">
              <p>It’s critical that you know how to access different information sources to stay up to date during an earthquake.</p>
              <p>During mobile network outages, radio is often the most reliable source of information. It is essential to have a battery-powered radio or another device capable of receiving broadcasts on AM/FM frequencies to stay informed in such situations.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div data-w-id="0afd2dfa-ade2-84c1-a97c-3f0c589c9d69" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(100px, null, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="text-only-column-right no-margin w-col w-col-6 w-col-stack">
            <ul role="list" class="list-10 w-list-unstyled">
              <li class="list-item"><img src="../../../images/ewa-icon-black_1ewa-icon-black.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-55">
                <p class="table-copy">
                  <a href="https://www.emergency.wa.gov.au/" target="_blank">Emergency WA Website</a>
                </p>
              </li>
              <li class="list-item"><img src="../../../images/fb-icon.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-26">
                <p class="table-copy">
                  <a href="https://www.facebook.com/dfeswa" target="_blank">DFES Facebook</a>
                </p>
              </li>
              <li class="list-item"><img src="../../../images/mobile-icon.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-26">
                <p class="table-copy">Call 13 DFES: <strong>133 337</strong></p>
              </li>
              <li class="list-item"><img src="../../../images/radio-icon.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-26">
                <p class="table-copy">Listen to <a href="https://www.abc.net.au/local/" target="_blank">ABC local radio</a>
                </p>
              </li>
              <li class="list-item"><img src="../../../images/bom-icon.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-26">
                <p class="table-copy">
                  <a href="http://www.bom.gov.au/" target="_blank">Bureau of Meteorology</a>
                </p>
              </li>
              <li class="list-item"><img src="../../../images/mobile-icon.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-26">
                <p class="table-copy">
                  <a href="https://www.mainroads.wa.gov.au/travel-information/" target="_blank">Main Roads WA</a> or call <strong>138 138</strong>
                </p>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
